comment4.text=\r\n\ If\ heath\ does\ not\ equal\ 100\ hundred\ then\ a\ heart\ will\ pop\ up\ every\ 5\ seconds\ in\r\n\ a\ random\ spot\ on\ the\ screen.\r\n
