comment5.text=\r\n\ takeHealth\ will\ subtract\ whatever\ amout\ of\ damage\ is\ neccisary\r\n\ after\ hitting\ an\ ememy\ or\ enemy\ projectile.\r\n\ If\ the\ current\ Health\ is\ less\ than\ or\ equal\ to\ zero\ the\ game\ will\ stop.\r\n
